"entity": {
"name": "SunocoCorp LLC",
"description": "SunocoCorp LLC engages in operating crude oil pipelines and terminals. It operates through the following segments: Fuel Distribution, Pipeline Systems, Terminals, and Refinery. The Fuel Distribution segment includes distribution of motor fuels and other petroleum products to customers that include third-party dealers and distributors, commission agent operators, and commercial businesses. The Pipeline Systems segment includes an integrated pipeline and terminal network consisting of 6,000 miles of refined product pipeline. The Terminal segment operates four transmix processing facilities and 83 terminals. The Refinery segment is composed of the Burnaby Refinery with an operational capacity of 55,000 barrels per day. The company was founded on June 6, 2000 and is headquartered in Dallas, TX.",
"rbics_econ": "Energy",
